  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario de relaciones y sentimientos**",
      "",
      "| Tema | Palabras |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| **Relaciones** | *friend · best friend · acquaintance (conocido) · partner · colleague · flatmate · neighbour · ex* |",
      "| **Cualidades** | *loyal · honest · reliable · generous · supportive · funny · caring · selfish · rude* |",
      "| **Sentimientos positivos** | *delighted · thrilled · proud · relieved · grateful · content* |",
      "| **Sentimientos negativos** | *jealous · guilty · upset · disappointed · lonely · anxious · furious* |",
      "| **Acciones** | *get on / get along · fall out · make up · split up · keep in touch · drift apart · look up to · count on* |",
      "",
      "**Estructuras**",
      "",
      "- *I feel + adjetivo*: *I feel guilty.*",
      "- *I'm jealous / proud / afraid / fond **of** + sustantivo o -ing.*",
      "- *I get on well **with** + persona.*",
      "- *We have a lot **in common**.* · *We don't see eye to eye.* (no coincidimos)",
      "- *You can rely on / count on / depend on me.*",
      "",
      "**Adjetivos -ed / -ing**",
      "",
      "- *I'm **disappointed**.* (yo siento) / *It's **disappointing**.* (la cosa provoca)",
      "- *She's **annoyed** / **annoying**.* · *He's **worried** / **worrying**.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo — falsos amigos**",
      "",
      "- *Sensible* ≠ sensible (es 'sensato'); *sensitive* = sensible.",
      "- *Sympathetic* ≠ simpático (es 'comprensivo'); *nice / friendly* = simpático.",
      "- *Embarrassed* ≠ embarazada (es 'avergonzado'); *pregnant* = embarazada.",
      "- *Constipated* = estreñido.",
      "- *Jealous* (celos de pareja o envidia) ≠ *envious* (envidia sana).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *jealous* /ˈdʒeləs/ · *guilty* /ˈɡɪlti/ (la 'u' no suena) · *loyal* /ˈlɔɪəl/ · *honest* /ˈɒnɪst/ (la 'h' no suena)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I'm jealous for her.",
        "right": "I'm jealous of her.",
        "note": "Jealous of."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I'm very embarrassed (estoy embarazada).",
        "right": "I'm pregnant.",
        "note": "Embarrassed = avergonzado."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": [
